AGVN Player: spine-godot 4.2 (spine-runtimes e7dc1435) built into Godot 4.7 as an engine module. Godot 4.7 no
longer includes callable_mp.h, scene_tree.h and rendering_server.h through other headers, moved RenderingServer's
enums and types out of the class (RenderingServerEnums, RenderingServerTypes), renamed free() to free_rid(), gives a
Ref from memnew of a RefCounted class, and lists animation libraries in a LocalVector. The same changes as
spine-godot 4.3 (VERSION_MINOR >= 7), so older Godot builds as before. Applied by build-godot.sh with patch -p1.

